* Copyright (c) 2026, SD Core for Linux.  This program is free software; you can redistribute
* it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.
*
* START-HISTORY:
* 28 Oct 26 dm  S.88 L2: the four boxes are panes of the layout service ($tk_layout): at 140 by 43 exactly the boxes the page has always drawn, in a bigger window the Result box takes the
*               rows and every box is wider; the dry run keeps and shows as many changed records as the Result box has rows (at least the 20 it always did).
* 28 Oct 26 dm  S.88 phase 2 (S2): check.undo calls $tk_ownfile, the test moved out unchanged so that TOOL.QUERY makes the same one of &queries&.
* 27 Oct 26 dm  S.87 batch 13: digest(x, 0, 'MD5') for the removed md5(x) (the same 32 lower case hex characters).
