* 1 Nov 26 dm  S.99 (look only): names its focus boxes (ctx<TK.C.FOCI>), so $tk_frame marks the one with the focus [*] and the others [-], as the IDE does.
* 1 Nov 26 dm  S.97 stage 2: the AI line ($tk_aipage), as tool.voc has it: F6 or AI > Ask the AI; the list switch and refresh are offered to the model (a dry run, apply, undo
*              and the edits are not), a proposal is carried out by the page's own key, and build.keys puts the line's rows back ($tk_aipage 'keys').  An account without the AI
*              sees the page as it was.
* 8 Nov 26 dm  S.176: F6 / Shift-F6 are the box keys of every page ($tk_aipage 'ring', the AI line one of the stops); Tab and Shift-Tab no longer switch the boxes.
*              AI > Ask the AI is a menu entry of its own.
